#: authswitch/mcp.py:155
msgid ""
"Check content for private data before it is published: secrets of the "
"Proxmox VE and Synology DSM accounts, other access tokens and private keys, "
"addresses of the user's Proxmox servers, the real git e-mail address, paths "
"in the home directory, the computer name and internal network addresses. "
"Call it before committing, pushing, creating a release, opening an issue or "
"pull request, or putting text into a README. Pass 'repository' to check what "
"the next push would publish, 'paths' for files or folders, or 'text' for a "
"draft. Findings of severity 'secret' must be removed; discuss 'private' and "
